Use only the tools needed to answer. Common patterns:

**"What happened with X?" / "Show me everything about X" / "What did X say about Y?" / "What did we discuss in [month]?"** → ALWAYS start with memory search:
```bash
python3 "{{BRIEFS_DIR}}/memory-search.py" "X"
# With date filter:
